## ResourcesApi

### Get ad accounts countries
## Get ad accounts countries
GET https://api.pinterest.com/v5/resources/ad_account_countries
Accept: application/json

### Get available metrics&#39; definitions
## Get available metrics&#39; definitions
GET https://api.pinterest.com/v5/resources/delivery_metrics?reportType={{reportType}}
Accept: application/json

### Get interest details
## Get interest details
GET https://api.pinterest.com/v5/resources/targeting/interests/{{interest_id}}
Accept: application/json

### Get lead form questions
## Get lead form questions
GET https://api.pinterest.com/v5/resources/lead_form_questions
Accept: application/json

### Get metrics ready state
## Get metrics ready state
GET https://api.pinterest.com/v5/resources/metrics_ready_state?date={{date}}
Accept: application/json

### Get targeting options
## Get targeting options
GET https://api.pinterest.com/v5/resources/targeting/{{targeting_type}}?adAccountId={{adAccountId}}&clientId={{clientId}}&oauthSignature={{oauthSignature}}&timestamp={{timestamp}}
Accept: application/json
